      "criterion": "scope",
      "rationale": "Both approaches suffer from distinct failure modes: centralized audits risk regulatory capture and slow response times, while bounty markets risk 'safety-washing' where firms prioritize optics over deep security. Neither side has demonstrated a mechanism to ensure consistent, legally binding accountability at scale.",
